L["Existing stored CREATURE key: BEAST, DRAGONKIN, DEMON, ELEMENTAL, GIANT, UNDEAD, HUMANOID, CRITTER, MECHANICAL, OTHER, TOTEM, NONCOMBAT_PET or GAS_CLUUD."] = "Vorhandener gespeicherter CREATURE-Schlüssel: BEAST, DRAGONKIN, DEMON, ELEMENTAL, GIANT, UNDEAD, HUMANOID, CRITTER, MECHANICAL, OTHER, TOTEM, NONCOMBAT_PET oder GAS_CLUUD."
